   "heading": "TRIANGULATION INDEPENDENT PTOLEMY VARIETIES 1. Introduction The Ptolemy variety P n ( T ) of a topological ideal triangulation T of a compact 3 -manifold M was deﬁned by Garoufalidis, Thurston and Zickert [ 9 ]. It gives coordinates (called Ptolemy coordinates) for boundary-unipotent SL( n, C ) -rep",
